<title>UK: ING units sign $1.0 billion EMTN programme.</title>
<headline>ING units sign $1.0 billion EMTN programme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Verzekeringen NV (INGV) and ING America Insurance Holdings Inc (ING Inc) have signed a $1.0 billion Euro-MTN programme, arranger Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International said on Monday.</p>
<p>Issues under the name of ING Inc will be fully guaranteed by INGV, the insurance holding company of the ING Group, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The programme is rated AA-minus by Standard &amp; Poor's.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
